# LinkSOS Package List (x86_64) — LEAN LIVE ISO
# Target: <2GB ISO for GitHub Releases upload
#
# STRATEGY: The live ISO contains only what's needed to boot, run the desktop,
# and install the system. Heavy packages (gaming stack, NVIDIA drivers, lib32
# multilib, wine-mono/gecko, CJK fonts) are installed AFTER the user installs
# LinkSOS to disk, via the first-run wizard (linksos-setup-gaming script).
#
# This is the same approach used by Ubuntu, Fedora, etc. — the ISO is lean,
# and additional packages are added post-installation.
#
# RULES:
# - Only packages from core, extra, multilib, or archlinuxcn repos
# - AUR-only packages (calamares, tela-icon-theme) installed in customize_airootfs.sh
# - Heavy packages installed after disk install via linksos-setup-gaming

# === BASE SYSTEM ===
base
base-devel
linux-zen
linux-zen-headers
linux-firmware
linux-firmware-whence
systemd
systemd-sysvcompat
systemd-resolvconf
dbus-broker
util-linux
coreutils

# === BOOT & INSTALLER ===
grub
efibootmgr
os-prober
memtest86+
syslinux
squashfs-tools
# calamares → installed in customize_airootfs.sh (try archlinuxcn first, then AUR)

# === HYPRLAND DESKTOP ===
hyprland
waybar
rofi-wayland
dunst
swaybg
swayidle
swaylock
sddm
xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland
xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
polkit-kde-agent
qt5-wayland
qt6-wayland
glfw-wayland
xorg-xwayland

# === FILE MANAGER & BASIC UTILITIES ===
dolphin
konsole
gvfs

# === NETWORKING ===
networkmanager
iwd
nm-connection-editor
avahi
nss-mdns

# === AUDIO ===
pipewire
pipewire-pulse
pipewire-jack
pipewire-alsa
wireplumber
pavucontrol
pamixer
alsa-utils
# sof-firmware → installed post-install (only needed for specific Sound Open Firmware hardware)

# === THEMING ===
papirus-icon-theme
nwg-look
kvantum
qt5ct
qt6ct
gnome-themes-extra
# tela-icon-theme → installed in customize_airootfs.sh (AUR-only)

# === FONTS (minimal set; CJK/extra installed post-install) ===
noto-fonts
noto-fonts-emoji
ttf-font-awesome
ttf-jetbrains-mono
ttf-hack
ttf-dejavu
ttf-liberation
# noto-fonts-cjk → HUGE (~100MB), installed post-install
# noto-fonts-extra → installed post-install

# === BASIC GAMING (core only; full stack installed post-install) ===
wine
winetricks
# wine-mono, wine-gecko → ~200MB combined, installed post-install
# lutris, steam, mangohud, gamemode, gamescope, protontricks → installed post-install
# ALL lib32-* packages → installed post-install

# === BASIC GRAPHICS (software fallback + basic drivers) ===
mesa
vulkan-swrast
xf86-video-amdgpu
xf86-video-ati
xf86-video-intel
xf86-video-nouveau
# vulkan-radeon, vulkan-intel, vulkan-mesa-layers → installed post-install
# nvidia-dkms, nvidia-utils, lib32-nvidia-utils, nvidia-settings → installed post-install
# ALL lib32-vulkan-* → installed post-install

# === ESSENTIAL SYSTEM UTILITIES ===
htop
btop
fastfetch
git
